<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi{{{Case.First_Name__c}}},&nbsp;<br />
 &nbsp;<br />
Thank you for contacting Qantas Customer Care regarding your disrupted journey from {{{Case.Departure_City__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Arrival_Date_Time__c}}}. I was sorry to hear that the delay meant you missed your connection.<br />
<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
Though this disruption was out of our control, I can understand how frustrating it must have been and would like to apologise for the impact it had on your planned itinerary after your arrival in to {{{Case.Arrival_Airport__c}}}.<br />
<br />
When a flight is delayed, we take all available measures to minimise the disruption and our operations team will always rebook any onward connections on your ticket.<br />
<br />
<strong>We’re here to help</strong><br />
<br />
I’ve checked your booking and can see that your flight to {{{Case.Arrival_Airport__c}}} was on a separate ticket, so we can’t provide compensation on this occasion.<br />
<br />
However, if you had any unexpected expenses because of the &lt;delay/cancellation&gt;, your travel insurance policy may cover these sorts of situations.<br />
<br />
Please let us know if you’d like us to provide you with an insurance letter to assist with any claim – we're here to help.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>-If offering goodwill gesture due to tier of Frequent Flyer:-&nbsp;</em></strong><br />
<br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’ve credited {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account.</p>

<p><strong><em>If not a Frequent Flyer:-</em></strong></p>

<p>As a gesture of goodwill, I’d like to arrange a credit of {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to you.<br />
<br />
Please can you let me know your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email so I can credit points to your account. If you’re not already a member you can use this&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/en-au/frequent-flyer/join/code/familyfree">link</a>&nbsp;to join free of charge.<br />
<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and we hope you have a better experience next time you fly.</p>
</body>
</html>